    "display_name": "Attach the Event Listener",
    "long_instructions": "# Attach the Event Listener\r\n\r\n**Goal:** When the user clicks a button, your code should know which card was clicked.\r\n\r\n1. **Select the Buttons:** Use a selector to grab all reveal buttons after the cards render.\r\n2. **Add Click Handlers:** Attach an event listener to each button.\r\n3. **Target the Correct Card:** Make sure the click handler identifies the specific card (using an id, index, or data attribute).\r\n4. **Test the Click:** Show something like the card's id or index to the console or DOM to confirm your targeting works.",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Connect each card's button to a click event so only the selected card responds when the user clicks \"See More.\"",
